{
  "name": "Quiz Deadline Guard + Practice Quiz Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Quiz Deadline Guard (Free)\n\n**Setup (5 min):**\n1. Gemini: get a free key at aistudio.google.com, add it in both Gemini nodes.\n2. Connect Gmail + Google Calendar (OAuth) once.\n3. Replace `YOUR_EMAIL@gmail.com` in the 3 email nodes.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n**Flow A:** every morning, scans Gmail + Calendar for quizzes/deadlines and emails you a digest.\n**Flow B:** open Chat, say a topic, get a practice quiz (emailed on request).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "79bae8e5-f49d-4dab-8f05-2d316260570b",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1952,
        64
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2085b5b2-f02d-45e4-b45c-b9b6d5649468",
      "name": "Every Morning 8AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -1552,
        384
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "limit": 15,
        "filters": {
          "q": "newer_than:1d (quiz OR test OR assessment OR assignment OR \"last date\" OR deadline)"
        }
      },
      "id": "d51b76ba-9de6-402e-923a-b26cd3a7d1e0",
      "name": "Find Quiz Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
